# NASA FIRMS Area API key — free, issued near-instantly.
# Request one at https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/api/area/  (use the "Get MAP_KEY" control)
# then copy this file to `.env` and paste the key below.
#
# NOTE: the key is required ONLY for historical / custom-date-range pulls
# (the difference-in-differences panel and the model training data).
# The current-season keyless regional feeds in src/fire_policy/firms.py work without it.
FIRMS_MAP_KEY=
